                                                "sense_id": "8a165a6f-ce16-3187-b039-fe947388271c",
                                                "text": "Feebly ſhe ſhriekt, but ſo feebly indeed / That Britomart heard not the ſhrilling ſound."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b499b54-476c-4149-8d06-7b11938f95c7",
                                                "sense_id": "8a165a6f-ce16-3187-b039-fe947388271c",
                                                "text": "The hurt nigger moaned feebly somewhere nearby, and then fetched a deep sigh that made me mend my pace away from there."
                                            }
